ice Gloria riceve un mazzo di rose da un misterioso corteggiatore.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1982-05-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iHk2iLbGl5hh8KgIBXqWvTQ2clz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iHk2iLbGl5hh8KgIBXqWvTQ2clz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/37468/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"846329","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Una favola per Gigi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Anna viene scritturata per un provino per il ruolo di Cenerentola. Gigi si addormenta e sogna di essere Cenerentolo.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1982-05-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rfvAy7Dwvw2jeXuXV92hbzmq8mJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rfvAy7Dwvw2jeXuXV92hbzmq8mJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/37468/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"846331","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Il club di ping-pong","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"I capitani di vari club di sport invitano Gigi a iscriversi ma lui vuole iscriversi al club di ping pong dove si batterà con Andrew.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1982-05-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1VpfQWINglql7IAVVbXPpNxeZW4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1VpfQWINglql7IAVVbXPpNxeZW4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/37468/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"846334","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Susan contro Gigi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Susan dice a Gigi di scusarsi con Andrew ma lui si rifiuta in maniera categorica.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"1982-05-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"h